  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Bob Lazar, a man who says he worked on alien craft at a secret site called S4 near Groom Lake, the Nevada base also known as Area 51, says that in 1989 he took friends out into the desert to watch test flights. He says the first time, nobody knew they were out there, but on the last trip they were caught, and he was banned from S4. For him, it marks the end of his time inside the program."
